{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0213_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7b1c7d412ec836eb9a6408373b2556073586a32817f78e8df049629cd22d7470", "ja": "（歩のカナダでの撮影が終わり、帰国した）", "zh": "（步在加拿大的拍摄结束，已经回国了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0213_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d65964a4747aee85e7d915ec22e6c366ad9ab8ed6b0bfc0b7f012918281c46f3", "ja": "{$P$}！　アンの故郷も\nケベックシティも、どっちも最高だったね！", "zh": "{$P$}！安妮的故乡和\n魁北克城都棒极了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0213_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4969af4bc0f4bd96e855239f5180142ea8d2df58ed50c12f95f632459a38c69b", "ja": "はあ～、またカナダに行きたいな～！\nあのロマンあふれる街並み……夢に出てきそうだよ！", "zh": "唉～，真想再去一次加拿大啊～！\n那充满浪漫的街景……感觉都要出现在梦里了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0213_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d74ab9ae80682f8e6d69800897d04806b572a1a2606af44f887b89015fa0dab3", "ja": "あはは。\nよっぽどカナダが気に入ったんだな、歩。", "zh": "哈哈。你还真喜欢上加拿大了啊，步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0213_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9c14812e2bf80399d2614dcdde4a354c9195a4204f1c1c0e04f6ded78793aa33", "ja": "ま、まあね……カナダはアメリカに近いしさ。\nケベックだと、半分はフランス語だったけど。", "zh": "嗯、嗯，是啊……毕竟加拿大离美国很近嘛。\n在魁北克的时候，有一半人说法语。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0213_1005_p", "source_sha256": "13df12956b010c15f1211307961872f4c8ba8f17a78df89124a1db73f5638136", "ja": "しかし、順調な仕事でなによりだったよ。\n赤毛のアンの衣装も、歩によく似合ってたし。", "zh": "不过，工作进展顺利就再好不过了。\n《绿山墙的安妮》的服装也很适合步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0213_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ce83d492a84799a932f0d522a67bf93a05719f36493c5b5afa14ea75d8f05b52", "ja": "撮影もほぼ一発OKだったし、スタッフさん達や、\n協力してくれた現地の人達にも評判だったぞ。", "zh": "拍摄也几乎一次就通过了，工作人员和协助我们的当地人都赞不绝口。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0213_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8892acd5aa434ad8fa2e91ca1c7145a9a4f865e1edbfec83ef5e06227f8636fd", "ja": "あ、ありがとう。正直、アンっぽい雰囲気にするには\nどうしたらいいのか、アタシ最後までわかんなくて。", "zh": "啊，谢谢。说实话，要营造出安那样的氛围，我到最后都不知道该怎么做。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0213_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5c07467f3fbb2869af7a5c932046e51b96c8e062829939623239d909a084d485", "ja": "結局、素の自分のまま、カメラの前に\n立っちゃってたんだけど……それでよかったのかな？", "zh": "到头来，我就这样保持真实的自己，站在了镜头前……这样真的好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0213_1009_p", "source_sha256": "1b1de47b7b0bacb2826d97e5cb84eb8c634d84a5e8eb8c9d043b3cb3cff82ae4", "ja": "ああ、今回の仕事はバッチリだったと思う。\n歩に任せて正解だった。", "zh": "啊，我觉得这次的工作完成得非常棒。\n把它交给步果然没错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0213_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "76f7d0366ca0c0d503b01580ce95b56d268adb906e8d3a68328bb14174c55880", "ja": "へへ、アタシもアンの役ができて楽しかった♪\nそっかー、ああいう自然な感じでいいんだー。", "zh": "嘿嘿，我也很开心能出演安的角色♪\n原来如此——像那样自然的感觉就可以啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0213_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "067a9d20f5ec9a065e5b8968649c08a3960615f0d6b943eaa09c0339769c4c40", "ja": "いや～、でもアタシにしては珍しいよね。\nトラブルなしで撮影を乗り切れるなんて……。", "zh": "哎呀～，不过对我来说还挺少见的呢。\n拍摄居然能顺顺利利地搞定……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0213_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8ed4f635c04abc7669396b5229284160c850abcc79ae3f34fe558ef186905705", "ja": "いつもこうならいいんだけど、だいたい問題が……。\nふぁ～……あ、あれ？", "zh": "要是每次都这样就好了，可基本上都会出问题……\n哈～啊……咦，奇怪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0213_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f6a4645ec3e2130b0f0eb550005758cd5f50836fd95ce3192b82b15a17d64f42", "ja": "歩、どうした？　大丈夫か？\nふらついて……。", "zh": "步，怎么了？没事吧？\n你都站不稳了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0213_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5cdb076cd0bcb457bcd2812930a127a09cfac9ce08d5ee16a76e5d62b86ace45", "ja": "あ、うん。なんかいきなり……\nすっごい眠くなってきて……時差ボケかな……。", "zh": "啊，嗯。就是突然间……\n变得特别困……难道是时差反应吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0213_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "14ea2013ea07f964873fe0e4f111438ecec96ec396ad8e4c526e3e914ecb31bd", "ja": "ごめん、{$P$}……。\nちょっと腕貸してもらっていいかな……。", "zh": "抱歉，{$P$}……。\n可以借我靠一下胳膊吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0213_1016_p", "source_sha256": "9ee9f6f2e43f7754d2f7ddbe59cb514221a54a56137bfcb417d19e4df4052681", "ja": "そうだな、つかまってないと危なそうだ……。", "zh": "是啊，不抓紧点好像会有危险……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0213_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "69dd8fe3a8065714dc5dcc76b993e34d305927cfde59930c24199832fc0348b7", "ja": "う、うん……。じゃあ、しばらくこのままで……。\nちょっと……腕借りるね……ふぁ～。", "zh": "嗯、嗯……那我就暂时先这样……\n借你的……手臂靠一下哦……哈啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0213_1018_p", "source_sha256": "07cc9d0284dcd7195940df2012128185c739933a6e93c913d00d846a0eed476f", "ja": "（時差ボケに加えて、きっと長旅の疲れも\n出てきたんだろう……歩、本当にお疲れさま！）", "zh": "（除了时差反应，长途旅行的疲劳肯定也开始显现出来了吧……步，真的辛苦你了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
